Package: bwTools
Type: Package
Title: Native R Tools for BigWig, WIG, and bedGraph Files
Version: 0.7.5
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides native R implementations for reading and writing local
    BigWig files, indexed genomic retrieval, interval statistics, automatic
    multi-track merging, explicit signal aggregation, large-file performance
    benchmarking, and reading and writing WIG and bedGraph signal tracks.
    Version 0.7.5 retains the validated reader and exact-statistics baseline,
    vectorizes first-level zoom construction, and builds higher BigWig zoom
    levels hierarchically from the preceding summary level instead of rescanning
    the full signal for every reduction level.
    BigWig binary I/O uses base R random-access operations, binary encoding, and
    zlib compression without bundled C or C++
    code or external UCSC executables. Public in-memory signal coordinates are
    1-based closed.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
